      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    equity_market_value = 15_000_000\n    debt_market_value = 5_000_000\n    cost_of_equity = 0.12\n    cost_of_debt = 0.05\n    tax_rate = 0.25\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    total_value = equity_market_value + debt_market_value\n    equity_weight = equity_market_value / total_value\n    debt_weight = debt_market_value / total_value\n    after_tax_cost_of_debt = cost_of_debt * (1 - tax_rate)\n\n    wacc = (\n        equity_weight * cost_of_equity\n        + debt_weight * after_tax_cost_of_debt\n    )\n\n    # Return answer as a percentage to two decimal places\n    answer = round(wacc * 100, 2)\n    return answer\n```",
